   "body": "DW or 2H?\n\nalso do you ever cast earth quake?",
   "upvotes": 1,
   "created_at": "2026-07-20T05:19:28.670883+00:00",
   "updated_at": "2026-07-20T07:38:14.879767+00:00",
   "downvotes": 0,
   "hidden": false,
   "author": {
    "id": "27c57794-7464-4f12-b003-09eec557dc42",
    "username": "Thomas Abrahams",
    "avatar_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ5bujaV-jAID2Js8dpzBVYuJWK05tTAXYbr169phJoGepqDPEN=s96-c"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "004b75a8-fbfd-439e-adcd-270efea2b796",
   "build_id": "06a3a629-dd8e-4c6f-a0e1-6e9e17d63f74",
   "author_id": "ce0bd217-95b6-4467-8c1e-555c2cd4289e",
   "parent_id": "fb58fb05-9974-4598-b0ad-27cbc06d9910",
   "body": "I’ve primarily played with 2H as it makes your Wildclaws hit harder, which is good aoe cleave. As DW, I notice that spiritual frenzy is much higher on my meter meaning our kit is putting more reliance on the pet and micro’ing it.\n\nThe only time I’d suggest casting earthquake is while leveling and mostly pre-pull. The damage is about the same as getting off a couple wildclaws or a totemic smash and the cast time is rather long since we want to prioritize crit.",
   "upvotes": 0,
