  {
   "id": "8ac5f935-2ab0-4345-a071-7e93b5dc59fb",
   "build_id": "06a3a629-dd8e-4c6f-a0e1-6e9e17d63f74",
   "author_id": "ce0bd217-95b6-4467-8c1e-555c2cd4289e",
   "parent_id": "44a09c04-8c66-47e0-bb22-6a91a8a9b523",
   "body": "I use Rylak's Bite as a rage builder in ST or for movement. In a ST build you'd get rid of Totem Warrior and Wild Carnage to take Rylak's Blessing and Rexxar's Might, then you'd use it Rylak's Bite on CD to maintain pet stacks.",
