   "body": "Ignore the dude who says pets dont have talents. I go cobra reflex, its maths out to about a 10% dmg increase from the pet, culling the herd, spiders bite, call of the wild, wild hunt, dash and boars speed (the goddamn pet is always lagging behind), and one point of Stamina.  I didn't realize there was a pet tree till level 57",
